"If that time already passed today, it means tomorrow." = "如果该时间今天已过，则表示明天。";
"Runs past midnight into the next day." = "跨过午夜延续到第二天。";
"Keeps the Mac awake while a partial-download file (.crdownload, .download, .part, and the like) exists in the chosen folder, then lets it sleep once the download finishes. Holds for 30 seconds between files in a batch." = "只要所选文件夹中存在未完成的下载文件（.crdownload、.download、.part 等），就让 Mac 保持唤醒；下载完成后让其睡眠。一批文件之间保持 30 秒。";
"Stays awake on battery too; the display turns off when the lid closes. Turn it off before putting it in a bag." = "使用电池时也保持唤醒；合盖时显示器会关闭。放入包中前请将其关闭。";
"The calendar rule needs Calendar access (System Settings ▸ Privacy)" = "日历规则需要日历访问权限（系统设置 ▸ 隐私与安全性）";
