"Checks an always-on Mac (e.g. a headless Mac mini) needs. Keepresso can read these but can't change the system ones, so use the links and commands below." = "常开 Mac（例如无显示器的 Mac mini）所需的检查项。Keepresso 可读取这些项，但无法更改系统项，因此请使用下方的链接和命令。";
"macOS hops the Wi-Fi radio off-channel for AWDL about once a second, which shows up as ping spikes mid-game or mid-stream. Diagnose it here, and pause AWDL for the session if it's the culprit." = "macOS 大约每秒一次将 Wi-Fi 无线电切换到 AWDL 的其他信道，这会在游戏或串流中表现为 ping 尖峰。在此进行诊断，如果确为元凶，可在本次会话中暂停 AWDL。";
"Pings 1.1.1.1 five times a second for 10 seconds and checks whether latency spikes on AWDL's once-a-second cadence." = "以每秒五次的频率 ping 1.1.1.1 共 10 秒，并检查延迟是否按 AWDL 每秒一次的节奏出现尖峰。";
"Counts only while a game (or a cloud-gaming app) is the active window, not just running in the background. Keeps holding for 5 minutes after you switch away." = "仅在游戏（或云游戏 App）为活动窗口时计数，而不仅仅是在后台运行。切换离开后仍保持 5 分钟。";
"How long the pause lingers after the game stops being the active window, so a quick alt-tab doesn't flap the radios. Shorter brings AirDrop and Handoff back faster; longer rides out launchers and loading screens." = "游戏不再是活动窗口后暂停会持续多久，以免快速的 Alt-Tab 让无线电反复开关。更短能更快恢复 AirDrop 和 Handoff；更长则可平稳度过启动器和加载画面。";
"Posts a notification when a game is detected and AWDL pauses, and again when it resumes. A notice that your administrator password is needed is always sent (even behind a fullscreen game), regardless of this switch." = "在检测到游戏并暂停 AWDL 时发送通知，恢复时再次发送。无论此开关如何，都会始终发送需要管理员密码的提示（即使在全屏游戏后面）。";
"One step left, in System Settings: under General ▸ Login Items & Extensions (“Login Items” on older macOS), find Keepresso in the “Allow in the Background” list and turn its switch ON. macOS asks for your administrator password once; this updates by itself when you're done." = "还差一步，在“系统设置”中：在“通用 ▸ 登录项与扩展”（较旧 macOS 上为“登录项”）中，于“允许在后台”列表内找到 Keepresso 并打开其开关。macOS 会索要一次管理员密码；完成后此项会自动更新。";
"Turns the pause on right now and keeps it on until you turn it off or quit Keepresso (it isn't tied to whether a keep-awake session is brewing). While it's on, AirDrop, Handoff, Sidecar, and Continuity Camera take a break, and the once-a-second lag spikes stop. Everything comes back the moment you turn it off or quit Keepresso; even if the app crashes, macOS is restored automatically. With the administrator helper installed the switch is always instant and silent; without it, macOS asks for your password once per launch (the system dialog may show “osascript”, which is Keepresso running the command)." = "立即开启暂停，并保持开启，直到你将其关闭或退出 Keepresso（它与是否正在进行保持唤醒会话无关）。开启期间，AirDrop、Handoff、随航（Sidecar）和连续互通相机会暂停，每秒一次的延迟尖峰也会停止。一旦你关闭它或退出 Keepresso，一切都会立即恢复；即使 App 崩溃，macOS 也会自动还原。安装了管理员助理时，此开关始终即时且静默；未安装时，macOS 每次启动会索要一次你的密码（系统对话框可能显示“osascript”，那是 Keepresso 在运行该命令）。";
"Watches for a game (or a cloud-gaming app like GeForce NOW) as the active window and pauses AWDL on its own, then lifts the pause a little after you switch away (the delay below). It only counts while the game is in front and in use, not just running in the background. Without the administrator helper, turning this on asks for your password once per app run, right now rather than mid-game; with the helper it never asks at all. No trigger setup needed: leave this on and forget it." = "监视游戏（或像 GeForce NOW 这样的云游戏 App）是否为活动窗口，并自行暂停 AWDL，然后在你切换离开后稍过一会儿解除暂停（见下方延迟）。它仅在游戏位于最前并在使用时计数，而不仅仅是在后台运行。在没有管理员助理的情况下，开启此项会在每次 App 运行时索要一次你的密码，是现在而非游戏进行中；有助理时则完全不询问。无需设置触发条件：保持开启并无需操心。";
"Pause AWDL to steady your connection, and test your jitter, in Gaming & Streaming." = "在“游戏与串流”中暂停 AWDL 以稳定连接，并测试你的抖动。";
"Two independent switches. Preventing system sleep keeps the Mac itself running: work finishes, downloads complete, and it stays reachable over the network, while the screen is still free to turn off. Preventing display sleep also keeps the screen lit, which is what you want for a dashboard or a video, and what drains a battery fastest. Most setups want system sleep prevented and display sleep left alone." = "两个相互独立的开关。阻止系统睡眠可让 Mac 本身保持运行：任务能完成、下载能完结，并且始终可通过网络访问，同时屏幕仍可自由关闭。阻止显示器睡眠则会让屏幕保持点亮，这适合仪表盘或视频这类场景，也是最耗电的方式。大多数情况下应阻止系统睡眠，而让显示器睡眠保持原样。";
"“Launch at login” starts Keepresso itself when you log in, so the cup is always in the menu bar. “Start keep-awake on launch” goes further and begins a session right away, using the default duration, for an always-on Mac that shouldn't need a rule to stay up. It's ignored while triggers are controlling activation, since your conditions decide then." = "“登录时启动”会在你登录时启动 Keepresso 本身，让杯子始终留在菜单栏。“启动时开始保持唤醒”则更进一步，会立即以默认时长开始一个会话，适合那种不需要靠规则来保持运行的常开 Mac。当触发条件正在控制激活时，此项会被忽略，因为这时由你的条件决定。";
"Starts a session as soon as Keepresso launches." = "Keepresso 启动后立即开始一个会话。";
"System-wide, so it starts or stops keep-awake whatever app you're in. It needs at least one modifier key (Command, Option, Control, or Shift) so it can't fire while you're typing. Recording it asks for no Accessibility or Input Monitoring permission." = "全局生效，因此无论你在哪个 App 中，它都能开始或停止保持唤醒。它至少需要一个修饰键（Command、Option、Control 或 Shift），这样就不会在你打字时误触发。录制它不会请求辅助功能或输入监视权限。";
"Starts or stops keep-awake from any app." = "从任何 App 开始或停止保持唤醒。";
"Fifteen languages are available. Changing this relaunches Keepresso, so the menu, every window, and notifications all switch together instead of drifting apart. Set it back to “Follow System” to follow your Mac's language again." = "共有十五种语言可选。更改此项会重新启动 Keepresso，让菜单、每个窗口和通知一并切换，而不会各行其是。改回“跟随系统”即可再次跟随 Mac 的语言。";
"Keepresso follows your system language by default." = "Keepresso 默认跟随系统语言。";
"Handles the privileged switches for Keepresso, with no password prompts." = "为 Keepresso 处理特权开关，无需密码提示。";
"Keeping the Mac awake stops it sleeping, but it doesn't reset app-level or enterprise idle detection: remote-desktop and VDI sessions, meeting presence (Teams, Slack), and corporate idle-logout can still mark you away or log you out. This tells macOS you're active as well, which those do notice. It only steps in once you've been idle a few seconds, so it never nudges the pointer while you're using the Mac or gaming. Off by default, and some managed Macs flag simulated activity, so check your policy first." = "让 Mac 保持唤醒能阻止其睡眠，但不会重置 App 级或企业级的空闲检测：远程桌面和 VDI 会话、会议在线状态（Teams、Slack）以及企业空闲注销，仍可能把你标记为离开或将你注销。此选项还会告知 macOS 你处于活跃状态，而这些系统确实会留意到这一点。它只在你空闲几秒后才介入，因此在你使用 Mac 或玩游戏时绝不会移动指针。默认关闭，且某些受管理的 Mac 会标记模拟活动，请先查看你的策略。";
"Also tells macOS you're active, so you aren't marked away." = "同时还会告知 macOS 你处于活跃状态，这样就不会被标记为离开。";
"While a session runs, the menu shows these as one-click “Stop in” buttons. Clicking one converts the running session to end that much later, so the Mac goes back to sleeping on its own without you remembering to switch it off. It continues the session rather than restarting it, and clicking another button simply replaces the countdown. Up to four, and the list stays sorted." = "会话运行期间，菜单会将这些显示为一键“多久后停止”按钮。点按其中一个会把正在运行的会话改为在那之后结束，这样 Mac 会自行恢复睡眠，无需你记得手动关闭。它会延续当前会话而不是重新开始，点按另一个按钮只会替换倒计时。最多四个，列表始终保持排序。";
"One-click “Stop in” buttons shown in the menu while a session runs." = "会话运行时菜单中显示的一键“多久后停止”按钮。";
"A safety net for a session you forget about. If the charge falls this low, Keepresso pauses the session and lets the Mac sleep, even mid-session, and tells you why in a notification. The menu-bar cup shows the pause as a last sip of low-power yellow. Plugging in resumes it on its own. This is the same slider as the one in the menu, so the two always agree." = "为那些被遗忘的会话提供一道安全网。如果电量降到这个水平以下，Keepresso 会暂停会话并让 Mac 进入睡眠（即使在会话进行中），并通过通知告诉你原因。菜单栏杯子会把这次暂停显示为一口低电量黄色的“最后一口”。插上电源后会自动恢复。这与菜单中的滑块是同一个，因此两者始终保持一致。";
"Lets the Mac sleep once charge drops below this level, and switches off closed-display mode so a lid-closed Mac can sleep too." = "当电量降到此水平以下时让 Mac 进入睡眠，并关闭合盖模式，好让合盖的 Mac 也能睡着。";
"Writes everything you've configured (settings, trigger rules, and presets) to a JSON file, to keep as a backup or to carry to another Mac. The file is version-stamped and checked on import, so a file from a newer Keepresso is refused rather than half-read. Importing replaces your current configuration and ends any running session." = "将你配置的一切（设置、触发规则和预设）写入 JSON 文件，可用作备份或迁移到另一台 Mac。该文件带有版本标记，并在导入时进行校验，因此来自更新版 Keepresso 的文件会被拒绝，而不会被部分读取。导入会替换当前配置并结束任何正在运行的会话。";
"Save your settings, triggers, and presets to a JSON file." = "将你的设置、触发条件和预设保存到 JSON 文件。";
"Normally a MacBook sleeps the moment you shut the lid unless a display is attached. This keeps it running with the lid shut and nothing plugged in, on power or battery. The screen itself still turns off when the lid closes (unless an external display is attached), so it isn't lighting up uselessly inside the closed lid. It works by flipping a system setting (pmset disablesleep), so it stays in effect until you turn it off: closed and on battery, the Mac can still drain over time, so don't leave it on in a bag. “Only while brewing” ties it to the session instead, on when a keep-awake session starts, off when it ends or Keepresso quits (even after a crash). Both need administrator rights: silent with the administrator helper installed (see the top of this tab), otherwise macOS asks for your password, once per app run for “Only while brewing”." = "通常，MacBook 一合上盖子就会睡眠，除非连接了显示器。此选项能让它在合盖且未插接任何设备时继续运行，无论使用电源还是电池。合盖时显示器本身仍会关闭（除非连接了外接显示器），因此不会在合上的盖子内无谓地亮着。它的原理是切换一项系统设置（pmset disablesleep），因此在你将其关闭前会一直生效：合盖且使用电池时，Mac 仍可能随时间耗尽电量，所以不要在装入包中时保持开启。“仅在保持唤醒会话期间”则改为将其与会话绑定：在保持唤醒会话开始时打开，在会话结束或 Keepresso 退出时关闭（即使是崩溃之后）。两者都需要管理员权限：安装了管理员助理时为静默执行（见本标签页顶部），否则 macOS 会索要你的密码，“仅在保持唤醒会话期间”为每次 App 运行一次。";
"Keeps running with the lid shut and no external display." = "在合盖且无外接显示器时也能继续运行。";
"A trigger is a condition Keepresso watches, checked once a second. With triggers on, they take over: Keepresso starts brewing the moment your conditions are met and stops when they aren't, so you never leave the Mac awake by accident. The manual switch in the menu steps aside while they're active. “Pause Triggers” in the menu bar stops them temporarily without touching your rules." = "触发条件是 Keepresso 持续监视的一种状态，每秒检查一次。触发条件开启后会接管控制：一旦满足条件，Keepresso 便立即开始运行，条件不再满足时便停止，这样你就不会不小心让 Mac 一直保持唤醒。菜单中的手动开关在触发条件生效期间会让位。菜单栏中的“暂停触发条件”可在不改动规则的情况下临时停用它们。";
"The listed conditions control the session instead of the manual switch." = "列出的条件将取代手动开关来控制会话。";
"A preset is a named bundle of trigger rules you apply in one click. The built-ins cover common setups (AI Agent, Meetings, Cloud Gaming, Remote Control, and more), and applying one replaces your current rules. Save your own rules under a name to reuse them or move between setups. Renaming a built-in makes it yours, and Keepresso stops updating it. “Restore default presets” brings back any built-in you removed." = "预设是一组以名称保存的触发规则包，一键即可应用。内置预设涵盖常见场景（AI 智能体、会议、云游戏、远程控制等），应用其中一个会替换当前规则。将你自己的规则保存为一个名称，即可重复使用或在不同场景间切换。重命名某个内置预设会使其成为你自己的预设，Keepresso 将不再更新它。“恢复默认预设”可找回任何被移除的内置预设。";
"“any” keeps the Mac awake while at least one condition holds, so the rules pile up: add three and any of them is enough. “all” needs every one true at once, which narrows things down (on AC power and an external display connected means only while docked). Conditions are checked once a second, and Keepresso stops brewing as soon as they stop being met." = "“任意”会在至少一个条件成立时让 Mac 保持唤醒，因此规则会不断叠加：添加三条规则，只要其中任意一条成立即可。“全部”要求所有条件同时成立，这会缩小范围（接通电源且连接外接显示器意味着只有在接驳时才生效）。系统每秒检查一次条件，条件不再满足后 Keepresso 会立即停止运行。";
"Conditions Keepresso reads straight from the hardware, with no permission needed: whether you're on AC power, on battery, or charging, and whether an external display is connected. Good for a Mac that should only stay awake while it's docked or plugged in, especially combined with “all” to mean exactly that." = "这些条件由 Keepresso 直接从硬件读取，无需任何权限：是否接通电源、使用电池，或正在充电，以及是否连接了外接显示器。适合只应在接驳或插电时保持唤醒的 Mac，尤其是与“全部”组合使用，恰好表达这个意思。";
"Conditions about what the Mac is connected to or busy with: a chosen Wi-Fi network, a VPN, a Bluetooth device such as headphones or a controller, a mounted volume, or sustained network throughput for a large download, upload, or sync. Reading Wi-Fi names needs Location permission and Bluetooth needs its own, both requested from this menu; the rest ask for nothing." = "关于 Mac 正在连接什么或忙于什么的条件：指定的 Wi-Fi 网络、VPN、蓝牙设备（如耳机或手柄）、已装载的宗卷，或用于大型下载、上传或同步的持续网络流量。读取 Wi-Fi 名称需要定位权限，蓝牙则需要自己的权限，二者都会从此菜单请求；其余条件不需要任何权限。";
"Conditions about what you're actually doing: an app running or frontmost, the camera or microphone in use, audio playing, a game in front, an AI agent working, a process by name, a download finishing in a folder you watch, CPU load above a threshold, a time window, or a calendar event in progress. The camera and microphone conditions read only the device's in-use signal (the green dot), never the stream, so neither asks for permission." = "关于你实际在做什么的条件：某个 App 正在运行或位于最前、摄像头或麦克风使用中、正在播放音频、某个游戏位于最前、AI 智能体正在工作、按名称匹配的进程、你监视的文件夹中有下载完成、CPU 负载超过阈值、某个时间段，或某个日历事件正在进行。摄像头和麦克风条件只读取设备的使用中信号（绿点），从不读取实际画面或声音流，因此两者都不会请求权限。";
"A nudge while a session is running, so a Mac left awake doesn't stay awake all night unnoticed. Left off, a one-time reminder tells you once, after the session has run this long. “Repeat” tells you again at every interval until you stop the session. This never stops anything itself, it only reminds you, and the sound is optional. If you'd rather the session end on its own, use a timed session or a quick-stop button instead." = "在会话运行期间提醒你一下，避免忘记而让 Mac 整晚保持唤醒。若关闭，则一次性提醒只会在会话运行达到这个时长后提醒你一次。“重复”会在每个间隔再次提醒你，直到你停止会话。这本身从不会停止任何东西，只是提醒你，而且声音是可选的。如果你更希望会话自行结束，可以改用定时会话或快速停止按钮。";
"These cover the times a session ends without you: a timer expiring, trigger conditions dropping, or a low-battery pause. Stopping it yourself stays silent, since you already know. The warning is a heads-up a few minutes before a timed session runs out, so you can extend it before the Mac drops off. The action runs when the session ends: sleep the display or start the screen saver, handy for a Mac you walk away from. It's off by default so a timed session never surprises you." = "这涵盖了会话在你不知情时结束的情况：定时器到期、触发条件不再满足，或低电量暂停。你自己停止时不会提醒，因为你已经知道了。警告会在定时会话结束前几分钟提前提醒你，以便你能在 Mac 掉线前延长会话。该操作会在会话结束时执行：使显示器进入睡眠或启动屏幕保护程序，适合那种你会离开一段时间的 Mac。它默认关闭，因此定时会话不会让你意外。";
"Fires when a session ends on its own, not when you stop it yourself." = "在会话自行结束时触发，而不是在你自己停止时。";
"A Mac with no monitor attached falls back to a fuzzy 1920 × 1080, which is what makes Screen Sharing and VNC look soft. This creates a higher-resolution HiDPI display in software, so the remote picture is crisp without plugging anything in. It uses a private macOS API, so treat it as experimental and expect it may break on a macOS update. A hardware HDMI or DisplayPort dummy plug does the same job with no software at all." = "没有连接显示器的 Mac 会回退到模糊的 1920 × 1080 分辨率，这正是屏幕共享和 VNC 显得模糊的原因。此功能会在软件层面创建更高分辨率的 HiDPI 显示器，因此无需插接任何设备即可获得清晰的远程画面。它使用了 macOS 私有 API，因此请将其视为实验性功能，并预期 macOS 更新可能使其失效。硬件 HDMI 或 DisplayPort 假负载能达到同样效果，且完全无需软件。";
"For a Mac with no monitor: a sharper picture over Screen Sharing and VNC." = "适用于没有显示器的 Mac：通过屏幕共享和 VNC 获得更清晰的画面。";
"Many external drives and NAS volumes park or disconnect after a few minutes idle, and the next thing that touches them stalls while they spin back up. Keepresso rewrites a tiny hidden marker file in the folder you choose, just enough activity to keep the volume awake. Pick an interval shorter than the drive's own idle timeout. This runs whenever Keepresso is running, with or without a keep-awake session, so a drive stays ready even when the Mac is free to sleep." = "许多外置硬盘和 NAS 宗卷会在空闲几分钟后停转或断开连接，此后第一个访问它们的操作会因为等待重新启动而卡顿。Keepresso 会在你选择的文件夹中重写一个微小的隐藏标记文件，只产生刚好足够的活动来让该宗卷保持唤醒。请选择一个比硬盘自身空闲超时更短的间隔。只要 Keepresso 在运行，无论是否有保持唤醒会话都会执行此操作，因此即使 Mac 可以自由睡眠，硬盘也始终保持就绪。";
"Stops an external drive or NAS from spinning down." = "防止外置硬盘或 NAS 停转。";
"General" = "通用";
"Triggers" = "触发条件";
"Reminder" = "提醒";
"Disk" = "磁盘";
"Activity" = "活动";
"Indefinitely" = "无限期";
"Update Session" = "更新会话";
"Start" = "开始";
"Met, in grace period" = "已满足，处于宽限期";
"Met" = "已满足";
"Not met" = "未满足";
"Copied!" = "已复制！";
"Copy command" = "复制命令";
"OK" = "正常";
"Needs attention" = "需要处理";
"Tip" = "提示";
"Unknown" = "未知";
"Checking the helper" = "正在检查助理";
"One approval needed" = "需要一次批准";
"The helper needs a reinstall" = "助理需要重新安装";
"All set" = "一切就绪";
"Making sure Keepresso's helper is awake and answering." = "正在确认 Keepresso 的助理已唤醒并正常响应。";
"macOS turned the helper's background switch off, so it needs your approval again: in System Settings, under Login Items & Extensions, find Keepresso in App Background Activity and turn it on. Everything is password-free again right after." = "macOS 关闭了助理的后台开关，因此需要你再次批准：在“系统设置”的“登录项与扩展”中，于“App 后台活动”里找到 Keepresso 并将其打开。之后一切将再次无需密码。";
"Keepresso repaired the helper's registration, but macOS keeps disabling it. An old copy of Keepresso in the Trash is the usual cause: empty the Trash, then reinstall the helper below. Nothing else about your setup changes." = "Keepresso 已修复助理的注册，但 macOS 一直将其停用。通常原因是废纸篓中有旧的 Keepresso 副本：请清倒废纸篓，然后在下方重新安装助理。你的其他设置不会更改。";
"The helper is back. Closed-display mode and AWDL pausing work without password prompts again." = "助理已恢复。合盖模式和暂停 AWDL 再次无需密码提示即可工作。";
