"15 seconds" = "15 秒";
"A safety net for a Mac left running with the lid closed, slid into a bag with a session still holding it awake. It acts only in that trapped state: lid shut, with “Keep awake with the lid closed” overriding sleep. Watch macOS's own thermal pressure (works everywhere, “Serious” is where throttling bites) or specific temperature sensors, and if the reading stays over the threshold for the chosen time, Keepresso escalates: first, optionally, it boosts the fans (never below what the system chose, needs the administrator helper), and if it stays hot for the same time again, it pauses the session and switches the sleep override off, so the Mac can finally sleep and cool, telling you why in a notification. Opening the lid, or readings recovering, undoes everything: fan control returns to the system, the override comes back, and the session resumes. Die sensors on modern Macs routinely run at 90-100 °C under load, so thresholds around 95-100 °C are sensible." = "为合盖运行、被装进包里但仍有会话让它保持唤醒的 Mac 提供的安全网。它只在这种被困状态下起作用：盖子合上，且“合盖时保持唤醒”正在覆盖睡眠。它会关注 macOS 自身的热压力（在所有机型上都可用，“严重”是开始降频的临界点）或特定的温度传感器，如果读数在所选时间内持续超过阈值，Keepresso 会逐步升级：首先（可选）提升风扇转速（绝不会低于系统本身设定的转速，需要管理员助理），如果同样的时长内依旧过热，则会暂停会话并关闭睡眠覆盖，让 Mac 终于可以睡眠降温，并通过通知说明原因。打开盖子，或读数恢复正常，会撤销这一切：风扇控制权交还系统，睡眠覆盖恢复，会话继续。现代 Mac 的裸片（die）温度传感器在满载时经常处于 90-100 °C，因此阈值设在 95-100 °C 左右比较合理。";
"A small system service for the switches that need administrator rights: closed-display mode below, the thermal fan boost, and AWDL pausing in Gaming & Streaming. Without it, macOS asks for your password once per app run (and fan boost stays off entirely: fan control can't prompt). With it, everything is instant and silent: macOS asks once, when you approve the helper under Login Items, and the approval survives restarts and app updates. Updates never need a reinstall, the service replaces itself with the app. It can only flip those specific switches, everything it changes is restored if Keepresso quits or crashes, and you can remove it here at any time. It also puts the keepresso command-line tool on your PATH (Homebrew installs already have it). After removal, System Settings can keep showing a stale Login Items row until macOS refreshes its list. The status shown here is the real one." = "面向需要管理员权限的开关的一项小型系统服务：下方的合盖模式、风扇提速，以及“游戏与串流”中的暂停 AWDL。没有它时，macOS 每次 App 运行都会索要一次密码（风扇提速则完全无法使用：风扇控制无法弹出密码提示）。安装后，一切都即时且静默：macOS 只在你于“登录项”中批准该助理时索要一次密码，此批准会在重启和 App 更新后依然有效。更新永远不需要重新安装，该服务会随 App 一起自我替换。它只能切换这些特定开关，它所改动的一切都会在 Keepresso 退出或崩溃后恢复原状，你也可以随时在此处移除它。它还会把 keepresso 命令行工具加入你的 PATH（通过 Homebrew 安装的已自带）。移除后，“系统设置”可能会继续显示一个过期的登录项条目，直到 macOS 刷新其列表。这里显示的状态才是真实状态。";
