"How see-through the menu-bar dropdown is. Frosty (0%) backs its glass with blur and a wash of the window color, so text stays crisp on any wallpaper. Sliding toward 100% thins that backing away until the panel is the system's bare Liquid Glass, letting the desktop shine through, with some contrast cost on busy or very dark wallpapers. Changes apply instantly, only to the dropdown (windows like this one keep their standard look), and the system's Reduce Transparency accessibility setting always wins." = "菜单栏下拉面板的透明程度。“磨砂”（0%）会在玻璃背后叠加模糊效果和一层窗口色调，让文字在任何桌面背景下都保持清晰。向 100% 滑动会逐渐减薄这层背景，直至面板呈现系统原生的裸 Liquid Glass 效果，让桌面透出来，在繁杂或很暗的桌面背景下会有一定的对比度损失。更改会立即生效，且只影响这个下拉面板（像这样的窗口仍保持标准外观），系统的“降低透明度”辅助功能设置始终优先。";
"Install a small helper service so closed-display mode, the thermal fan boost, and AWDL pausing work without password prompts. macOS will ask you to allow it in System Settings, once. Nothing else changes." = "安装一个小型助理服务，让合盖模式、风扇提速和暂停 AWDL 都能在无密码提示下使用。macOS 会要求你在“系统设置”中批准一次，其他一切都不会改变。";
