"Switching off closed-display mode during a heat pause needs the administrator helper. Watching temperatures and pausing work without it. Installing asks for your approval once, in System Settings." = "在因过热暂停期间关闭合盖模式需要管理员助理。没有它，监测温度和暂停功能仍可正常工作。安装只需在“系统设置”中批准一次。";
"System thermal pressure" = "系统热压力";
"Temperature sensors" = "温度传感器";
"Temperature threshold" = "温度阈值";
"Temperatures recovered" = "温度已恢复";
"Test Fans" = "测试风扇";
"Test stopped. Fan control is back with the system." = "测试已停止。风扇控制权已交还系统。";
"The Mac has cooled down. Keepresso is back to normal control." = "Mac 已降温。Keepresso 已恢复正常控制。";
"The administrator helper didn't accept fan control. Check its status in the section above, then run the test again." = "管理员助理未能接受风扇控制。请查看上方区块中的状态，然后重新运行测试。";
"The administrator helper didn't accept the fan boost. The rest of the thermal safety net still applies." = "管理员助理未能接受风扇提速。热安全网的其余部分仍照常生效。";
"The administrator helper is still updating itself to this version of Keepresso. Fan boost engages once that finishes, and the rest of the thermal safety net still applies." = "管理员助理仍在自我更新到此版本的 Keepresso。更新完成后风扇提速才会生效，热安全网的其余部分仍照常生效。";
"The fan test needs the administrator helper." = "风扇测试需要管理员助理。";
"The fans are boosted for heat right now, so the test stays off until readings recover." = "风扇目前正因过热而提速，因此测试功能会保持关闭，直到读数恢复正常。";
"The fans didn't follow the boost, so this Mac's firmware likely refuses manual fan control. The rest of the thermal safety net still works, the boost stage will just be skipped." = "风扇未响应提速指令，此 Mac 的固件很可能拒绝手动风扇控制。热安全网的其余部分仍正常工作，只是会跳过提速阶段。";
"The firmware kept refusing manual fan control, so the fans are back with the system. The rest of the thermal safety net still applies." = "固件持续拒绝手动风扇控制，因此风扇控制权已交还系统。热安全网的其余部分仍照常生效。";
"The helper is updating itself to this version of Keepresso (no password needed). Fan boost and this test unlock when it finishes, usually under a minute." = "助理正在自我更新到此版本的 Keepresso（无需密码）。更新完成后风扇提速和此测试便会解锁，通常不到一分钟。";
"The helper service is updating itself to this version of Keepresso in the background. No reinstall or password is needed. Features new to this version wait until it finishes, usually under a minute." = "助理服务正在后台自我更新到此版本的 Keepresso，无需重新安装或输入密码。此版本新增的功能会等待更新完成，通常不到一分钟。";
