"Thermal" = "温控";
"Appearance" = "外观";
"If the Mac runs hot with the lid closed, the session pauses so it can sleep and cool down." = "如果 Mac 在合盖时过热，会话会暂停，让它得以睡眠降温。";
"The menu-bar dropdown's glass, from frosty to clear Liquid Glass." = "菜单栏下拉面板的玻璃效果，从磨砂到通透的 Liquid Glass。";
