"Edit hook" = "编辑钩子";
"Event hooks" = "事件钩子";
"Fires a few seconds after a natural end, not on a manual stop or a safety pause." = "在自然结束后数秒执行，手动停止或安全暂停时不会。";
"How long Keepresso held the Mac awake each day, from the decision log. Battery drop is shown when both ends of a session had a reading." = "根据决策日志，Keepresso 每天保持 Mac 唤醒多久。仅当会话两端都有读数时才显示耗电。";
"Indefinite" = "不限时";
"Installing a wake schedule needs the administrator helper (Preferences ▸ General)." = "设置唤醒计划需要管理员助理（偏好设置 ▸ 通用）。";
"Locks via System Events. macOS may ask once for Automation access for Keepresso." = "通过 System Events 锁定。macOS 可能向 Keepresso 请求一次“自动化”权限。";
"No event hooks yet." = "尚无事件钩子。";
"No held-awake time in the last week." = "过去一周没有保持唤醒的时间。";
"Notifications fire when a session ends on its own, not when you stop it yourself." = "会话自行结束时会通知，你自己停止时不会。";
"Off" = "关";
"One step left: allow Keepresso under Login Items in System Settings. Scheduled wake unlocks by itself." = "还差一步：在系统设置的登录项中允许 Keepresso。计划唤醒会自行解锁。";
"One-shot wake" = "单次唤醒";
"One-shot: %@" = "单次：%@";
"Reliable on AC power. On battery the firmware may skip the wake." = "接通电源时可靠。用电池时固件可能跳过唤醒。";
"Repeat daily / weekly" = "每日/每周重复";
"Repeating: every day at %@" = "重复：每天 %@";
"Run a Shortcut, post a webhook, or a shell command on session and trigger events. No helper required." = "在会话和触发事件上运行快捷指令、Webhook 或 shell 命令。不需要助理。";
"Scheduled wake" = "计划唤醒";
"Scheduled wake needs the administrator helper, the same one closed-display mode and fan boost use. Install once, and macOS asks for approval in System Settings." = "计划唤醒需要管理员助理，与合盖模式和风扇加速相同。安装一次即可，macOS 会在系统设置中请求批准。";
"Session length" = "会话时长";
"Shell" = "Shell";
"Shortcut" = "快捷指令";
"Shortcut name" = "快捷指令名称";
"Sleeps the Mac through the administrator helper (instant, no extra prompts)." = "通过管理员助理让 Mac 睡眠（即时，无额外提示）。";
"Start keep-awake on wake" = "唤醒后保持不休眠";
"Starts keep-awake on wake" = "唤醒时启动保持唤醒";
"System one-shot wakes: %@" = "系统单次唤醒：%@";
"System repeating: %@" = "系统重复：%@";
"The administrator helper could not update the system wake schedule." = "管理员助理无法更新系统唤醒计划。";
"The helper is updating itself (no password). Scheduled wake unlocks when that finishes, usually under a minute." = "助理正在自行更新（无需密码）。完成后计划唤醒会解锁，通常不到一分钟。";
"The helper is updating itself. Until that finishes, sleep falls back to System Events, which may ask for Automation access once." = "助理正在自行更新。完成前，睡眠回退到 System Events，可能请求一次自动化权限。";
"The helper is waiting for approval in System Settings. Until then, sleep falls back to System Events, which may ask for Automation access once." = "助理正在系统设置中等待批准。在此之前，睡眠回退到 System Events，可能请求一次自动化权限。";
"These cover the times a session ends without you: a timer expiring, or trigger conditions dropping. Stopping it yourself stays silent, since you already know. The warning is a heads-up a few minutes before a timed session runs out, so you can extend it before the Mac drops off. Actions that put the Mac to sleep live under Automation." = "覆盖你不在场时会话结束的情况：计时到期或触发条件消失。自己停止则保持安静。警告在定时结束前几分钟发出，便于延长。让 Mac 睡眠的操作在“自动化”中。";
"Time" = "时间";
"Total" = "合计";
"Turn Off Wake Schedule" = "关闭唤醒计划";
"Turn on a one-shot time, a repeating time, or both. With neither, nothing is installed on the system." = "打开单次时间、重复时间，或两者都开。都不开则不会在系统上安装任何内容。";
"Uses every day (MTWRFSU). macOS allows only one system-wide repeating power schedule." = "每天（MTWRFSU）。macOS 全系统只允许一套重复电源计划。";
"Wake at" = "唤醒时间";
"Wake schedule" = "唤醒计划";
"Wake schedule not installed" = "未安装唤醒计划";
"Wake the Mac at a set time through the administrator helper (pmset schedule / repeat), then optionally start a keep-awake session so it does not fall back asleep before the job runs. Pair with an end-of-session action above for wake, work, sleep. Scheduled wake is reliable on AC power. On battery the firmware may skip it. macOS only allows one system-wide repeating power schedule, so enabling ours replaces whatever was there. The controls stay locked until the helper is installed and ready, the same rule as the thermal fan boost." = "通过管理员助理在设定时间唤醒 Mac（pmset schedule / repeat），并可选择启动保持唤醒，以免任务开始前再次入睡。可与上方会话结束动作搭配：唤醒、工作、睡眠。接通电源时可靠。用电池时固件可能跳过。macOS 全系统只允许一套重复电源计划，启用我们的会替换已有计划。控件在助理就绪前保持锁定，与热风扇加速相同。";
"Webhook" = "Webhook";
"When a keep-awake session ends on its own (a timer expiring, or trigger conditions dropping), Keepresso can put the display to sleep, lock the screen, start the screen saver, or sleep the Mac. Off by default so a timed session never surprises you. Manual stops, and the battery and thermal safety pauses, never run this action. A brief debounce cancels it if the session restarts right away." = "当保持唤醒会话自行结束（计时到期或触发条件消失）时，Keepresso 可使显示器睡眠、锁定屏幕、启动屏保或让 Mac 睡眠。默认关闭，以免定时会话吓人。手动停止以及电池/热安全暂停从不执行此操作。若会话立刻重启，短暂防抖会取消它。";
"When something happens in Keepresso, run a Shortcut, POST a webhook, or run a shell command. Useful for a push to your phone when an overnight agent finishes (ntfy, or a Shortcut that sends a notification). Hooks are suspended while you edit them, so a half-written command never runs. No administrator helper needed. User-authored shell commands are intentional in this unsandboxed app: only add commands you trust." = "Keepresso 中发生事件时，运行快捷指令、POST Webhook 或 shell 命令。适合通宵智能体结束后推送到手机（ntfy 或发通知的快捷指令）。编辑时钩子暂停。不需要管理员助理。在此未沙盒应用中允许用户 shell 命令：只添加你信任的命令。";
"When the Mac wakes near this schedule, Keepresso starts a session so it does not fall back asleep. Works best with triggers off for that window, or with a trigger that stays satisfied." = "若 Mac 在此计划附近唤醒，Keepresso 会启动会话以免立刻再睡。该时段最好关闭触发条件，或使用会持续满足的条件。";
"Why each session started or stopped, newest first. Saved on disk and restored after a relaunch." = "每次会话为何开始或停止，最新在前。已存盘，重新启动后恢复。";
"Without the administrator helper, sleep uses System Events and may ask for Automation access once. Install the helper under Preferences ▸ General for instant, silent sleep." = "没有管理员助理时，睡眠走 System Events，可能请求一次自动化权限。在偏好设置 ▸ 通用安装助理可即时、静默睡眠。";
"https://…" = "https://…";
"−%d%% battery" = "−%d%% 电量";
"Held awake by an automation lease" = "由一个自动化租约保持唤醒";
"Held awake by %d automation leases" = "由 %d 个自动化租约保持唤醒";
"and %d more" = "还有 %d 个";
"Allow automation leases" = "允许自动化租约";
"Allow automation to change the wake schedule" = "允许自动化更改唤醒计划";
"Automation access" = "自动化访问";
"A lease is a bounded keep-awake grant an outside tool asks for through the keepresso command line or the bundled MCP server: an AI agent working overnight, a render script, a backup job. Each lease has a time limit its owner must keep renewing, plus a hard seven day ceiling, so a crashed tool can never hold the Mac awake for good. The menu shows every live lease, Stop ends them all, and the Mac can sleep again after the last one finishes. Turning leases off ends any live lease. The wake schedule switch is separate and off by default because a scheduled wake is a system-wide change applied by the administrator helper: leave it off unless a tool you trust should plan wake-ups for you." = "自动化租约是外部工具通过 keepresso 命令行或内置 MCP 服务器申请的一种有限期保持唤醒授权：例如通宵工作的 AI 智能体、渲染脚本，或备份任务。每个租约都有时限，其持有者必须不断续期，此外还有严格的七天上限，因此即使工具崩溃，也永远无法让 Mac 永久保持唤醒。菜单会显示所有存活的租约，“停止”会一次性结束全部，最后一个结束后 Mac 便可再次睡眠。关闭租约功能会结束所有存活租约。唤醒计划开关是独立的，默认关闭，因为计划唤醒是由管理员助理执行的系统级更改：除非你信任的工具应替你安排唤醒时间，否则请保持关闭。";
"Copy Agent Instructions" = "复制智能体说明";
"Copy MCP Setup" = "复制 MCP 设置";
"For Claude Code (JSON)" = "适用于 Claude Code（JSON）";
"For Gemini CLI (JSON)" = "适用于 Gemini CLI（JSON）";
"For Grok (JSON)" = "适用于 Grok（JSON）";
"For Codex (TOML)" = "适用于 Codex（TOML）";
"Server path only" = "仅服务器路径";
"Reveal Skill Folder" = "显示技能文件夹";
"Copied. Paste it to your agent in a new chat to teach it to manage Keepresso." = "已复制。请在新对话中粘贴给你的智能体，教它管理 Keepresso。";
"Copied. Paste it into your agent's MCP configuration file." = "已复制。请将其粘贴到你的智能体的 MCP 配置文件中。";
"Copied. Use it as the MCP server command in your agent's settings." = "已复制。请将其用作你的智能体设置中的 MCP 服务器命令。";
"After the last session ends" = "最后一个会话结束后";
"When the last thing keeping the Mac awake ends on its own (a timer expiring, trigger conditions dropping, or the final automation lease releasing), Keepresso can put the display to sleep, lock the screen, start the screen saver, or sleep the Mac. Leases count: while any lease is live the session continues and nothing fires. Off by default so a timed session never surprises you. Manual stops, and the battery and thermal safety pauses, never run this action. A brief debounce cancels it if the session restarts right away." = "当保持 Mac 唤醒的最后一件事自行结束时（计时到期、触发条件消失，或最后一个自动化租约释放），Keepresso 可使显示器睡眠、锁定屏幕、启动屏保或让 Mac 睡眠。租约同样计入：只要还有租约存活，会话就会继续，此操作不会执行。默认关闭，以免定时会话吓人。手动停止以及电池和热安全暂停，从不执行此操作。若会话立刻重启，短暂防抖会取消它。";
"While you play" = "游戏时";
"Give the game high CPU priority" = "让游戏获得更高的 CPU 优先级";
"Raises the active game or streaming app's CPU priority through the administrator helper, so background work (builds, backups, agent sessions) cannot steal frames. Normal priority comes back after you stop playing, and always when the game quits." = "通过管理员助理提高当前游戏或串流 App 的 CPU 优先级，让后台工作（构建、备份、智能体会话）无法抢占帧率。停止游戏后优先级恢复正常，游戏退出时也总会恢复。";
"Needs the administrator helper (Preferences ▸ General): raising a process's priority is a root-only change." = "需要管理员助理（偏好设置 ▸ 通用）：提高进程优先级是只有 root 权限才能执行的更改。";
"Boosting the current game." = "正在提升当前游戏的优先级。";
"Keep the display awake with a controller" = "用手柄让显示器保持唤醒";
"Controller input does not always count as user activity, so a gamepad-only session can dim or sleep the display mid-game. While a game is in front, a controller is connected, and a keep-awake session is active, Keepresso reports activity for you every half minute." = "手柄输入并不总是被计为用户活动，因此仅靠手柄游玩时，显示器可能在游戏进行中变暗或睡眠。当游戏位于最前、手柄已连接，且保持唤醒会话处于活动状态时，Keepresso 会每半分钟为你报告一次活动。";
"Game controller connected" = "已连接游戏手柄";
"Counts while any game controller is connected, wired or Bluetooth. Rides out a brief reconnect for half a minute." = "只要连接了任何游戏手柄（有线或蓝牙）即计数。短暂断线重连时可平稳度过半分钟。";
"One step left: allow Keepresso under Login Items in System Settings. The priority boost unlocks by itself." = "还差一步：在系统设置的登录项中允许 Keepresso。优先级提升会自行解锁。";
"The helper is updating itself (no password). The priority boost unlocks when that finishes, usually under a minute." = "助理正在自行更新（无需密码）。完成后优先级提升会解锁，通常不到一分钟。";
"Raising a game's priority is a root-only change, so it needs the administrator helper, the same one closed-display mode and fan boost use. Install once, and macOS asks for approval in System Settings." = "提高游戏优先级是只有 root 权限才能执行的更改，因此需要管理员助理，与合盖模式和风扇提速使用的是同一个。安装一次即可，macOS 会在系统设置中请求批准。";
"Locked until the helper is ready" = "锁定，直到助理就绪";
"macOS scans for AirDrop, Handoff, and Sidecar peers on the same Wi-Fi radio about once a second, and each hop can spike your ping. That reads as stutter in cloud gaming, remote play, and live streams. The watchdog turns those hops off (pausing the AWDL interface) while you play and brings everything back afterward, automatically with the game detection below or manually with the switch." = "macOS 大约每秒一次在同一 Wi-Fi 无线电上扫描 AirDrop、Handoff 和随航（Sidecar）的对等设备，每次跳频都可能让你的 ping 出现尖峰。这在云游戏、远程游玩和直播中会表现为卡顿。看守会在你游玩时关闭这些跳频（暂停 AWDL 接口），并在之后恢复一切：可通过下方的游戏检测自动完成，也可通过开关手动完成。";
"The stutter fix for streaming and online gaming." = "串流与联机游戏的卡顿修复。";
"Steam is downloading" = "Steam 正在下载";
"Counts while Steam is actively downloading or updating a game in any of its libraries, and lets the Mac sleep once the download finishes or is paused. Reads Steam's own bookkeeping, no permission needed." = "只要 Steam 正在任意库中主动下载或更新游戏就计数，下载完成或暂停后即可让 Mac 睡眠。读取 Steam 自身的记录，无需权限。";
"%@ · next %@" = "%@ · 下次 %@";
"%d automation leases are waiting (safety pause)" = "%d 个自动化租约正在等待（安全暂停）";
"A few basics" = "几项基础设置";
"Activation is controlled by triggers.\nEnd the automation leases before pausing." = "启用由触发条件控制。\n暂停前请先结束自动化租约。";
"Add app" = "添加 App";
"Add one in Claude Desktop (Routines ▸ New routine ▸ Local), Codex (Scheduled tasks ▸ Create), or tokenstat.ai (Automations), then refresh. Cloud routines run on the vendor's servers and need no wake." = "在 Claude Desktop（例行任务 ▸ 新建例行任务 ▸ 本地）、Codex（计划任务 ▸ 创建）或 tokenstat.ai（自动化）中添加一个，然后刷新。云端例行任务在供应商的服务器上运行，无需唤醒。";
"An automation lease is waiting (safety pause)" = "有一个自动化租约正在等待（安全暂停）";
"Awake for a scheduled run" = "为计划运行保持唤醒";
"Battery below %d%%, Keepresso sessions paused until plugged in" = "电量低于 %d%%，Keepresso 会话已暂停，直到接通电源";
"Choose app…" = "选择 App…";
"Choose how you use your Mac and Keepresso sets up matching triggers. It then keeps the Mac awake only while those conditions hold, and lets it sleep otherwise. You can adjust or add triggers in Preferences." = "选择你使用 Mac 的方式，Keepresso 会设置相应的触发条件。之后它只在这些条件成立时让 Mac 保持唤醒，其余时间则允许其睡眠。你可以在偏好设置中调整或添加触发条件。";
"Click the cup in the menu bar to keep your Mac awake, and click again to let it sleep." = "点按菜单栏中的杯子图标即可让 Mac 保持唤醒，再次点按则让它睡眠。";
"Common call apps" = "常见通话 App";
"Copied. Paste it into the scheduled task's prompt, so its agent holds the Mac awake for the run." = "已复制。将其粘贴到计划任务的提示词中，让其智能体在运行期间让 Mac 保持唤醒。";
"Copy Run Instructions" = "复制运行说明";
"Dim the display when idle" = "空闲时调暗显示器";
"Docked to a display" = "接驳显示器";
"End Automation Leases" = "结束自动化租约";
"Instead of holding the screen at full brightness, lower it to its dimmest after a few minutes with no input, then bring it back the moment you return. The display stays awake, just dark: kinder to the panel and the battery on long overnight sessions." = "不再让屏幕保持最大亮度，而是在几分钟无操作后将其调至最暗，你一回来就立即恢复。显示器仍保持唤醒，只是变暗：这样在整夜的长时间会话中，对屏幕面板和电池都更友好。";
"It also protects your Mac, pausing on low battery or high temperature." = "它还会保护你的 Mac，在电量过低或温度过高时暂停。";
"Keep awake while this app is using the microphone (on a call)." = "在该 App 使用麦克风（通话中）期间保持唤醒。";
"Keeping awake for calls in" = "正在为通话保持唤醒：";
"Keeping this Mac awake for “%@” to run." = "正在让这台 Mac 保持唤醒，以便运行“%@”。";
"Keepresso keeps your Mac awake from the menu bar, with no Dock icon and no main window." = "Keepresso 从菜单栏让你的 Mac 保持唤醒，没有程序坞图标，也没有主窗口。";
"Keepresso reads the recurring tasks your local AI tools schedule (Claude Desktop local routines, Codex automations, tokenstat.ai automations), wakes the Mac a few minutes before each run, and holds it awake for a short window so the run is not skipped. It reads only the schedule and name, never the task's prompt. Cloud routines run on the vendor's servers even with the lid shut, so they are neither listed nor woken for. For a run longer than the window, have the agent hold a Keepresso lease (see the command line and MCP setup below) and the Mac stays awake until it releases." = "Keepresso 会读取本地 AI 工具安排的定期任务（Claude Desktop 的本地例行任务、Codex 的自动化任务），在每次运行前几分钟唤醒 Mac，并在一小段时间内保持唤醒，以免运行被跳过。它只读取计划和名称，绝不读取任务的提示词。云端例行任务即使合盖也会在供应商的服务器上运行，因此既不会被列出，也不会为其唤醒。若运行时间超过这段窗口，可让智能体持有一个 Keepresso 租约（参见下方的命令行和 MCP 设置），Mac 会一直保持唤醒，直到该租约释放。";
"Keepresso runs in the menu bar. Click the cup at any time, or open Preferences for everything else." = "Keepresso 在菜单栏中运行。随时点按杯子图标，或打开偏好设置进行其他操作。";
"Keeps the Mac awake only while a chosen app is using the microphone, i.e. on a call (Discord, Slack, Zoom, and the like), so an idle browser tab or Voice Memos doesn't. Reads which app holds the mic, no permission needed. If you're on a call now, the app appears under “Using the mic now”." = "只在所选 App 使用麦克风时才让 Mac 保持唤醒，也就是通话中（Discord、Slack、Zoom 等），因此空闲的浏览器标签页或语音备忘录不会触发。读取哪个 App 占用麦克风，无需任何权限。如果你现在正在通话，该 App 会出现在“正在使用麦克风”下方。";
"Leases are off. Turn on “Allow automation leases” under Automation access for the agent's lease to hold." = "租约功能已关闭。请在“自动化访问”下打开“允许自动化租约”，智能体的租约才能生效。";
"Microphone in use by app…" = "麦克风正被 App 使用…";
