"No local scheduled runs found" = "未找到本地计划运行";
"One step left: allow Keepresso under Login Items in System Settings. Waking for scheduled AI runs unlocks by itself." = "还差一步：在系统设置的登录项中允许 Keepresso。为计划 AI 运行而唤醒会自行解锁。";
"Or set up triggers, so it stays awake automatically only while you are on a call, downloading, or gaming." = "或者设置触发条件，让它只在你通话、下载或玩游戏时自动保持唤醒。";
