"Scheduled wakes on this Mac: %@" = "此 Mac 的计划唤醒：%@";
"Stay awake for" = "保持唤醒：";
"Stay awake whenever an external display is connected." = "只要连接了外接显示器，就保持唤醒。";
"Stay awake whenever your Mac is running on AC power." = "只要 Mac 使用交流电源，就保持唤醒。";
"The helper is updating itself (no password). Waking for scheduled AI runs unlocks when that finishes, usually under a minute." = "助理正在自行更新（无需密码）。完成后（通常不到一分钟），为计划 AI 运行而唤醒即会解锁。";
"These local runs would be woken for once the helper is installed." = "安装助理后，系统便会为这些本地运行执行唤醒。";
"This is the Mac's whole wake schedule, including macOS's own (Do Not Disturb, backups). Turning Keepresso's schedule off clears the wake it set." = "这是此 Mac 的完整唤醒计划，包括 macOS 自身设置的项目（勿扰模式、备份）。关闭 Keepresso 的计划会清除它设置的唤醒。";
"This window is a fallback. For a run that lasts longer, have the task's own agent hold a Keepresso lease for the whole session, so the Mac stays awake until the work is done, then sleeps." = "这段时间窗口只是一个后备方案。如果运行时间更长，可让任务自己的智能体在整个会话期间持有一个 Keepresso 租约，这样 Mac 会一直保持唤醒直到工作完成，然后再睡眠。";
"Turn on a platform to wake for its runs. Left off, they stay listed but are never woken for." = "打开某个平台即可为其运行唤醒。保持关闭时，它们仍会列出，但永远不会被唤醒。";
"Using the mic now" = "正在使用麦克风";
"Wake for scheduled AI runs" = "为计划 AI 运行而唤醒";
"Wake the Mac for local Claude Desktop, Codex, and tokenstat.ai tasks, then hold it awake while they run." = "为本地 Claude Desktop、Codex 和 tokenstat.ai 任务唤醒 Mac，并在其运行期间保持唤醒。";
"Waking for scheduled AI runs needs the administrator helper, the same one closed-display mode and fan boost use. Install once, and macOS asks for approval in System Settings." = "为计划 AI 运行而唤醒需要管理员助理，与合盖模式和风扇提速使用的是同一个。安装一次后，macOS 会在系统设置中请求批准。";
