"Keyboard Cleaner" = "键盘清洁";
"Locks the keys so you can wipe the keyboard without typing into whatever is in front. The pointer still works: click Unlock when you are done." = "锁定按键，这样你可以擦拭键盘，而不会在前台内容中输入文字。指针仍可使用：完成后点按“解锁”。";
