"Public Wi-Fi" = "公共 Wi-Fi";
"When a cafe or airport network associates but never shows a login page, start here. Nothing runs until you click a button." = "如果咖啡馆或机场网络已连接却始终不显示登录页面，请从这里开始。点按按钮前不会执行任何操作。";
