"Public Wi-Fi…" = "公共 Wi-Fi…";
"Method" = "方法";
"Refresh" = "刷新";
"A small system service for the switches that need administrator rights: closed-display mode below, Keyboard Cleaner, the thermal fan boost, AWDL pausing in Gaming & Streaming, and flushing DNS from the Public Wi-Fi assistant. Without it, macOS asks for your password once per app run (and fan boost stays off entirely: fan control can't prompt). With it, everything is instant and silent: macOS asks once, when you approve the helper under Login Items, and the approval survives restarts and app updates. Updates never need a reinstall, the service replaces itself with the app. It can only flip those specific switches, everything it changes is restored if Keepresso quits or crashes, and you can remove it here at any time. It also puts the keepresso command-line tool on your PATH (Homebrew installs already have it). After removal, System Settings can keep showing a stale Login Items row until macOS refreshes its list. The status shown here is the real one." = "这是一个小型系统服务，用于需要管理员权限的开关：下方的合盖模式、键盘清洁器、散热风扇加速、游戏与串流中的 AWDL 暂停，以及公共 Wi-Fi 助手中的 DNS 刷新。没有它，macOS 会在每次运行 App 时要求你输入一次密码，而且风扇加速会完全保持关闭，因为风扇控制无法弹出密码请求。有了它，一切都会立即且安静地完成：当你在登录项中批准该助理时，macOS 只会询问一次，且批准在重启和 App 更新后仍然有效。更新从不需要重新安装，服务会随 App 自行替换。它只能切换这些特定开关，如果 Keepresso 退出或崩溃，它所做的所有更改都会恢复，而且你随时可以在此将其移除。它还会将 keepresso 命令行工具加入你的 PATH，Homebrew 安装已经具备此项。移除后，系统设置可能仍会显示过时的登录项行，直到 macOS 刷新列表。这里显示的状态才是真实状态。";
"Power / cursor warp" = "电源 / 光标偏移";
"F15 key every 60 s" = "每 60 秒按一次 F15 键";
"Shift every 60 s" = "每 60 秒按一次 Shift";
"Specified key" = "指定按键";
"Mouse move" = "鼠标移动";
"Key" = "按键";
"Key %d" = "按键 %d";
"Needs Accessibility for this method." = "此方法需要辅助功能权限。";
"Keeping the Mac awake stops it sleeping, but that does not keep you active in other software. Meeting and chat apps, remote desktop and VDI, cloud gaming, and many other tools still apply their own idle timeout: they mark you away, disconnect, or end the session. This reports activity so you stay present. The default method needs no extra permission. Some software only notices a real key or mouse, so you can pick F15, Shift, a specified key, or a posted mouse move. Those need Accessibility, requested only when you choose them, never at launch. F15 is the usual pick (most keyboards lack it, so nothing is typed). Shift is invisible. A specified key or mouse move covers software that only watches those. A letter or number will type into the front app. It only steps in once you've been idle a few seconds, so it never types or nudges while you're using the Mac. Off by default." = "让 Mac 保持唤醒可以阻止它睡眠，但不会让你在其他软件中保持活跃。会议和聊天 App、远程桌面和 VDI、云游戏以及许多其他工具仍会采用自己的空闲超时策略：它们会将你标记为离开、断开连接或结束会话。此功能会报告活动，让你保持在线。默认方法不需要额外权限。有些软件只会注意到真实的按键或鼠标，因此你可以选择 F15、Shift、指定按键或发送的鼠标移动。这些方法需要辅助功能权限，只会在你选择时请求，绝不会在启动时请求。F15 是常见选择，因为大多数键盘没有它，所以不会输入任何内容。Shift 不会显示。指定按键或鼠标移动可适用于只观察这些输入的软件。字母或数字会输入到前台 App。它只会在你空闲几秒后介入，因此在你使用 Mac 时绝不会输入或移动鼠标。默认关闭。";
"Reports activity so you stay present in apps that have their own idle timeout." = "报告活动，让你在有自己空闲超时策略的 App 中保持在线。";
"Prompt-free. Some apps ignore this and need a key or mouse method." = "无需弹出权限请求。有些 App 会忽略此方法，需要使用按键或鼠标方法。";
"Posts F15 every 60 s. A common pick for software that watches the keyboard." = "每 60 秒发送一次 F15。适合监测键盘的软件的常见选择。";
"Taps Shift every 60 s. Invisible, and nothing is typed." = "每 60 秒按一次 Shift。不会显示，也不会输入任何内容。";
"Taps the recorded key every 60 s. Prefer a function key or modifier." = "每 60 秒按一次录制的按键。建议使用功能键或修饰键。";
"Posts a 1-pixel mouse move every 60 s. For software that watches the pointer." = "每 60 秒发送一次 1 像素的鼠标移动。适用于监测指针的软件。";
"Helper installed. Closed-display mode, Keyboard Cleaner, fan boost, AWDL pausing, and DNS flush work without password prompts." = "助理已安装。合盖模式、键盘清洁器、风扇加速、AWDL 暂停和 DNS 刷新都无需弹出密码请求即可使用。";
"Install a small helper service so closed-display mode, Keyboard Cleaner, the thermal fan boost, AWDL pausing, and DNS flush work without password prompts. macOS will ask you to allow it in System Settings, once. Nothing else changes." = "安装一个小型助理服务，让合盖模式、键盘清洁器、散热风扇加速、AWDL 暂停和 DNS 刷新无需弹出密码请求即可使用。macOS 会要求你在系统设置中允许它一次。不会有其他变化。";
